      "summary": "Restaurant and Convenience Store",
      "description": "Located in the Crossroads building in Global Village, the Cafe and Market at Crossroads features a food court and convenience store. Inside of Crossroads are eight different food stations: grill, salad bar, pasta toss, pizza, Asian cuisine, deli, chef specials, and visiting chefs. <br /><br />\nThis location is cashless everyday after 7 p.m. Customers using cash may use a Tiger Spend Reload Station to add funds to an existing RIT ID card or a Reload Card.",
